{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "dec02db1-a5cd-5911-82c1-ee1a343816cd", "source_ordinal": 2646, "reading_ordinal": 1407, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "忌女色", "published_at": "2022-08-09T13:59:06+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/363779795/answer/2617584161"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这道理朴素得很。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你是本地出了名的高手，你还天天鼓吹“适当性生活有利竞技状态”，", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那不好意思——本地有强奸案、意外怀孕案，要么万幸现场抓到，要抓不到那就都是你干的。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你不是会飞檐走壁吗？", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你不是会移形换影吗？", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你不是会飞剑千里之外取人首级吗？", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你解释解释，人家大小姐大门不出二门不迈，怎么怀的孕？", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "跟大板子哥好好解释一下。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "看看你的屁股能不能说服它。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 175}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为何自古武术家都忌惮女色？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“忌女色”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这道理朴素得很。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这道理朴素得很。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ec0484f5-cb65-56a1-bc61-195e16308946", "source_ordinal": 2645, "reading_ordinal": 1408, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "知的义务", "published_at": "2022-08-11T02:14:42+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/547093057/answer/2620463222"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "医生给人看病，算不算利用人的无知谋利？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "去看病，不就是因为不知道自己得了什么病、也不知道怎么治吗？", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "老师收学费，算不算利用人的无知谋利？这个更典型，不解释了。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为人自身的无知而提供服务，并因为这个服务收取费用，是非常正当的行为。这极大的减少了你成为万事通的必要性，可以让每个人腾出大量的精力去专注在自己的专业上。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "每个人凭借自己的专业知识获取利益，换取别人的专业知识，实现互通有无，这是很好的安排——唯独对没有专业知识的人除外。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以，你必须要学习，必须要有所积累，不然你在这种知识交换里总是处于被动劣势。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "指责这个安排是没有意义的，因为人类没有更好的替代方案。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "无替代方案的方案自动无罪。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "好在这个世界上的知识非常宽阔，总有某个角落能让你安身立命，这并非高不可攀，所以“没有任何具有交换价值的知识”其实是没有借口的。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "或者更准确的说——这个借口也许可以让你身边的人闭嘴，但在现实面前无效。爹妈可以闭嘴不念叨你了，但还是赚不到生活费啊。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 419}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "现在说一个特殊的地方——签合同时能不能“利用对方对法律的无知”？", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "在这里，你假设了一个“理所当然的义务”——合同双方有义务向对方解释合同的条款。", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个想法大错特错。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 503}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为对方给你的口头解释本身没有与合同文本同等的法律效力。", "char_start": 504, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果合同文本本身让你充满疑虑，经过对方口头解释令你满意了，那么存在于ta的解释中而不存在于合同文本中的部分就应该被纳入到合同文本之中去，成为合同文本的一部分。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果没有纳入到合同文本之中，那么对方的解释就没有法律效力。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "换言之，没有被合同文本本身说服，而被对方的解释说服，这对听解释的一方是非常危险的。", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而从另一方面，作为出合同的一方，可以应你所请带着你浏览一遍合同，但这并不叫做“解释合同条款”，而叫做“介绍合同条款”。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "因为对合同条款的解读权利根本就不在向你介绍条款的人手里。", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 773}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所谓“解释合同的权利”、是指关于某个条款的一切不同版本的理解，均要以此人所认定的版本为准。", "char_start": 774, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这个权利事实上在法院手里。", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 833}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "法院认定你这表达了什么意思，你就是什么意思，无论你是甲方还是乙方，你们单独认定的都无效。你们各自请律师也罢，自己做理解也罢，始终都要注意，你要确认的是这话在法院看来会是什么意思，而不是在自己或对方、或各自所请的顾问看来是什么意思。", "char_start": 834, "char_end": 949}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "请律师，是请律师帮忙确认法院会怎么认定，而不是律师自己怎么认定。", "char_start": 950, "char_end": 982}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "换言之，合同的解释权根本不在对方手上。", "char_start": 983, "char_end": 1002}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你们有时可以看到“本公司对此活动条款保持最终解释权”这种话，就可以确认“该公司”老板是法盲，这种解释权在法律上基本上是不予承认的，基本没有有效的保护作用。", "char_start": 1003, "char_end": 1080}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "既然连解释权根本都没有，无权解释，哪来“解释的义务”？", "char_start": 1081, "char_end": 1108}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不止没有解释的义务，你甚至应该禁止对方尝试解释，以免干扰你的判断。", "char_start": 1109, "char_end": 1142}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你只能仅以合同文本为准，对你自己的理解负责。事后证明理解错了，就自己总结错误，而不要考虑什么“对方的解释误导了我”。", "char_start": 1143, "char_end": 1201}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "话说清楚——被“误导”了，也是你自己的责任。", "char_start": 1202, "char_end": 1224}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "没人有义务因为你的无知而对你给予任何特权和优待，因为自己的无知而遭受的一切损失，都纯然的是你自己的责任，没人对此有赔偿义务。", "char_start": 1225, "char_end": 1287}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "人自身有避免无知的义务，不尽这义务，把不尽这义务的后果强加到别人头上，试图通过某种“社会运动”“集体发声”来强迫其他人给无知的人特殊的优待，让ta们凭空的减少义务、生活格外轻松，这是徒劳无功的。", "char_start": 1288, "char_end": 1385}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "因为这是在呼吁奖励和优待无知。", "char_start": 1386, "char_end": 1401}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "哪个社会奖励和优待无知，哪个社会就要灭亡。", "char_start": 1402, "char_end": 1423}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "自然不讲情面，没得商量。", "char_start": 1424, "char_end": 1436}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待利用他人的无知进行谋利这一行为？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“知的义务”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“医生给人看病，算不算利用人的无知谋利？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "医生给人看病，算不算利用人的无知谋利？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "60841c05-0d09-5b33-bda3-7a075dc85f10", "source_ordinal": 2644, "reading_ordinal": 1409, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小报告", "published_at": "2022-08-11T06:05:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/463565795/answer/2620518512"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "报警电话、投诉电话是干什么的？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "报警、投诉和“打小报告”的本质区别是什么？", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "西方人比你想象的“喜欢打小报告”得多。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "香港人、日本人有样学样，对于“投诉”“举报”也热衷得很。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“提倡积极检举”反倒是国际惯例。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "认为这是“中国独有”，觉得“中国特别严重”，纯属于既不读历史、也不看世界的结果。", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "宗教裁判所哪来的“女巫情报”？法国大革命怎么决定要杀谁？德国怎么杀了几百万犹太人？安博林又是怎么死的？美国杀了多少逃亡黑奴？罗马杀了多少基督徒？怎么杀的？“麦卡锡主义”从哪来的？怎么执行的？", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不管是历史上还是现当代，西方社会的检举揭发风气一向比中国严重，极少例外。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "反倒是中国向来有根深蒂固的“私了”“息讼”传统，不但民众普遍避讳引入公权力解决问题，讲究“生不入官门”，甚至公权力自己都有“民不告官不究”“无为而治”的长期消极倾向。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 361}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "说话之前先调查一下反例，做点基本的自我怀疑，不然纯属自己编故事骗自己。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这是非常恶劣的行为逻辑。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "既无聊，又危险。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 419}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：各位有没有发现国内小报告举报风气特别浓?为何?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“小报告”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“报警电话、投诉电话是干什么的？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "报警电话、投诉电话是干什么的？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3bf94520-85e1-54d0-a50e-6173cf3e9184", "source_ordinal": 2643, "reading_ordinal": 1410, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "丁香医生", "published_at": "2022-08-12T04:19:45+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/f0e8813019b211edb24652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "又不是销号，有什么大不了的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "老实说，这恐怕还是保护了他们，给了他们一条生路走。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "少扯什么“科学与政治无关”。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在中国科学是主流信仰，以科学之名说出来的话在政治上形同中世纪坎特伯雷大主教或者君士坦丁堡牧首讲的话。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "自认为凌驾于行政利益之上，只要是“神启”都应该理所当然的有对万民广播的天然自由，这是一种幼稚可笑到近乎猖狂的傲慢。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 164}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "几千年的神权和王权之争，最后的唯一结果就是政教分离、凯撒的要归凯撒。", "char_start": 165, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "无论换什么信仰体系，结果都一样。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为人类社会根本没有第二种运行方式。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "任何效力等效神谕的信息，都必然要被纳入行政框架约束，对其传播过程加以干预和管理。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "对你怎么“批判”、“憎恶“这个安排，这个安排仍然是现在唯一实践了没导致毁灭的方案。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在哪里都一样。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "仔细想想，很明显所谓“学术自由”，“科普自由”只不过是新一轮化了妆的“神权至上”、“教权至上”。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "除了新神换旧神，有何本质区别？", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不识庐山真面目，只缘身在此山中。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "What a poetic irony.", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 429}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待「丁香园」系列账号被禁言？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“丁香医生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“又不是销号，有什么大不了的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "又不是销号，有什么大不了的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a5d469ca-ec51-5425-9881-20dc4c62a232", "source_ordinal": 2642, "reading_ordinal": 1411, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "谈的必要", "published_at": "2022-08-14T02:59:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/548219694/answer/2625442864"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么人可以说有“成熟的爱人的能力”呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "也不能说完全没有吧，但至少比例是很小的。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你看看中年人的离婚率、亲子矛盾，这都是很显然的“爱人的能力不够成熟”的表现。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不成熟的人不成熟的爱着不成熟的人，这是人间常态。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "尽力而为，不要执着结果。失败了就失败了，屡败屡战就是了。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "人生要紧的是不留白，不是不吃亏。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "开始和结束不是看物质上亏或者赚的预期，而是看你自己的意愿。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "循爱而行，你很不容易陷入到义理亏欠不能脱身的困境，于是总是可以想开始就开始，想结束就结束，并不需要任何别的顾忌，也不需要给人什么解释，更不需要对方认可你什么解释。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "真正沉重的是这种强制性的羁绊，而不是爱本身。是这种恩连祸结的纠缠，使得亲密关系成为深不见底、令人却步的深渊。是用伪装成爱的诱饵制造的伦理高利贷。但这方面的种种陋风劣习，流毒天下，深入骨髓，", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只要是爱，无论技巧熟不熟，这份自由总会为对方留着。这是爱的起点，迈出第一步已经超越了这条线。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只要这份自由完整无缺，那又需要犹豫什么？", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 425}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果男女双方都没有成熟的爱人的能力？那这段恋爱还有必要谈吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“谈的必要”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么人可以说有“成熟的爱人的能力”呢？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么人可以说有“成熟的爱人的能力”呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ccb66591-4c8d-5dc2-8ee0-6ae986e9f5bc", "source_ordinal": 2641, "reading_ordinal": 1412, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "天地无用", "published_at": "2022-08-14T06:27:47+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/547629190/answer/2625489912"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个世界上存在的最大规模的愚蠢，就是苦也经了、亏也吃了、事也做了，一秒钟都没跑掉、一分懒也没偷着，但除了满腹怨气，什么都没落下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "自己消极抵抗，把一段生命搞得没有任何收获，用来“证明”xxxx“毫无意义”。然后用这种“证据确凿”的所谓“毫无意义”，想去“控诉”“报复”那些将这些经历“强加”于自己身上的人。自以为这叫“反抗精神”，甚至“革命精神”。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这只不过是一种纯粹的愚蠢。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "参加完军训，结论是“军训没用”，只说明你自己对自己的生命根本不珍惜。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对于一个自强的——准确的说，珍惜生命的人，一个真正活着的人——而言，别说军训，坐牢都有用。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "什么叫“没用”？", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一段生命“没用”，只有一种可能，就是自己浪费了，跟“别人”没有必然关系。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你的生命有没有意义，取决于别人有没有服务好你？取决于别人有没有捣乱？别人要是没服务好你，你的生命就可以没意义了？然后怪别人就行了？", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这个世界上的事，其实根本没有什么事发生在你和别人之间的。一切都是发生在你和世界之间。“别人”只是你直接“触摸”世界的部位罢了。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你难道会说你在驾驶方向盘？你会说你在驾驶汽车，不是吗？", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "会说别人打了你的角质层？你会说别人打了你，不是吗？", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 501}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "军训看似发生在教官和你之间，或者——往上提几级也行——发生在学校与你之间、国家与你之间。好像你可以去要求教官收手、要求国家改变主意，似乎决定权就在ta们手里，这是你和ta们之间的恩怨，用威逼利诱解决了ta们就行了。", "char_start": 502, "char_end": 609}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但这里的教官、学校、国家……归根到底不过是世界的“方向盘”“角质层”。", "char_start": 610, "char_end": 645}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "真正把这事放在你身上的是整个世界。是这个世界通过历史下的命令，国家只是在服从。", "char_start": 646, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "世界把命运摆在你面前，你从来就没资格选择要什么、不要什么，你只能选择你要结什么果子。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你想用颗粒无收来证明它“没用”，它连眼皮都不会抬一下。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "它会毫不犹豫地饿死你。", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "年轻人最容易犯的致命错误，就是被形形色色的骗子、厚颜无耻的阿谀奉承之徒哄骗得丧失基本理智，妄想通过“抱怨”这种廉价的方式“改变世界”来逃避自己的问题。", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "轻轻松松浪费半辈子。", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "世界不关心人是怎么学会这种恶习的，它只会一轮轮的毒打那些挨了打还不改的，直到ta们被打死。", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 901}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "几百万年了，长点心吧。", "char_start": 902, "char_end": 913}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何反驳军训有用论？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“天地无用”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个世界上存在的最大规模的愚蠢，就是苦也经了、亏也吃了、事也做了，一秒钟都没跑掉、一分懒也没偷着，但除了满腹怨气，什么都没落下。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个世界上存在的最大规模的愚蠢，就是苦也经了、亏也吃了、事也做了，一秒钟都没跑掉、一分懒也没偷着，但除了满腹怨气，什么都没落下。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 64, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "01245eac-78ed-504e-9a87-8f594815562e", "source_ordinal": 2640, "reading_ordinal": 1413, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "十足真金", "published_at": "2022-08-14T20:08:43+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/546106233/answer/2626470804"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然不是。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "规则是这样的——只要你的行为动机中存在一点成分是自觉的、主动的无私的博爱，不用这个含量到达100%，只要它含量有个1%、0.1%、0.0001%，你这行为都算存在真正的爱。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“纯粹的博爱”指向的不是“真正的爱”，而是“完美的爱”。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "只要含金，就含的是真正的金。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "哪有“只有纯金才算真正的金”的道理？", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这其实只是个非常直白的语言问题，不需要神奇的分析能力，只从字面就知道是错的了。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 195}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：本质上，是否只有纯粹的博爱才算真正的爱？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“十足真金”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然不是。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然不是。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "38b1a286-bab2-516b-a9c4-5b26c85ccba7", "source_ordinal": 2639, "reading_ordinal": 1414, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "尽职尽责", "published_at": "2022-08-15T01:42:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/548305401/answer/2626871162"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "是个好爸爸。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不知道山洪的危险是无知、是愚蠢。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但是无知和愚蠢是人自身无法选择的。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人类总是会陷入因为自身的无知和愚蠢所造成的困境之中。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "高手、大师，陷入的困境海拔高点，庸人、蠢人，陷入的困境海拔低点，但这只是问题出现的海拔高度不同，人人都将不可避免的在不同的高度上陷入同样的宿命困境，或迟或早、非此即彼，无人可以逃脱。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "嘲笑ta人的愚蠢，永远只能是五十步笑一百步。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你今天笑得适情畅意，明天你也一样。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "别看我笑傲江湖、横行天下，我也一样。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在我无知和愚蠢的地方，我也一样无知和愚蠢。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而且我无知和愚蠢的地方，一定也对某些人是常识性的错误。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "必然如此，对此我们无能为力。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "人不是用谁有知和无知来分高下的，而是在人陷入了自己无知和愚蠢所造成的困境时，用什么样的姿态去对待这困境，才分出了人的高下。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "单纯的如此，永远的如此。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这位父亲见识所限，避免不了这困境——谁能避免自己不知道存在的危险呢？哪怕这危险除了你所有人都知道，那又如何？", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你不知道，就是不知道，你不相信，就是不相信。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "在这个关头上，他所做的选择，是合格的。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "ta的命运是如此罢了。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 470}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我们无法祈求自己知道“应该”知道的一切——这无法成为一个有效的教训。", "char_start": 471, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我们只能祈求自己在考验到来时，能尽量尽职尽责罢了。", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果你嘲笑ta的无知，对你自己是有反噬的——因为这个心态无意间将“人应该知道一切常识”设为了一条及格线。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 584}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你做不到，会因此召来巨大的抑郁症风险，不要这样。", "char_start": 585, "char_end": 609}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0221"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：四川彭州男子用脊背为孩子挡洪水，不幸被冲走，如何评价这位男子？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“尽职尽责”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“是个好爸爸。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "是个好爸爸。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
